BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 748.0 Td (  The Upstream dwellers received five coins each moon from the celestial spirits. They could cho) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 738.0 Td (    ose to cast some into the river, knowing the water would triple it for their Downstream neig) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 728.0 Td (    hbors. The Downstream people, upon receiving this abundance, could return gifts upstream-tho) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 718.0 Td (    ugh the current made this journey harder, with no multiplication.) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 708.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 698.0 Td (  A wise elder taught: "True prosperity flows like the river itself. When Upstream shares genero) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 688.0 Td (    usly, Downstream flourishes and can return gratitude. Both villages grow rich together. But ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 678.0 Td (    when fear or greed stops the flow, both banks grow barren.") Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 668.0 Td (  ) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 658.0 Td (  Some moons, mist clouded the waters, and gifts appeared larger or smaller than they truly were) Tj ET
