BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 218.0 Td (        s knew: abundance multiplies not through hoarding, but through the eternal cycle of givi) Tj ET
BT /F1 8.0 Tf 48.0 208.0 Td (        ng and receiving.) Tj ET
